   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying hello",
     "texto": [
      "**Hallo** works with almost everyone. More formal: **Guten Morgen** (in the morning), **Guten Tag** (during the day) and **Guten Abend** (in the evening).",
      "To say goodbye: **Tschüss** (informal) or **Auf Wiedersehen** (formal)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Informal and formal «you»",
     "texto": [
      "**Du** means «you» (informal): for friends, family and young people. **Sie** means «you» (formal) and is always written with a capital letter. With adults you do not know, use **Sie**.",
      "To say your name: **Ich heiße Anna** (my name is Anna) or **Ich bin Anna** (I am Anna).",
      "To ask it: **Wie heißt du?** (informal) or **Wie heißen Sie?** (formal).",
      "When you meet someone: **Freut mich** (nice to meet you)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
